WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.270
<b>West Yarda</b>

00:11.510 --> 00:12.650
Oscar.

00:13.220 --> 00:14.180
How's it look?

00:14.930 --> 00:16.490
This is probably the one.

00:16.930 --> 00:19.730
The princess of Yarda who's gone missing...

00:21.660 --> 00:23.670
is in the middle of that sandstorm,

00:24.430 --> 00:26.230
in Cados Fortress.

00:27.330 --> 00:32.050
Thank you for allowing us 
this unannounced visit.

00:32.420 --> 00:35.950
I'm Oscar Lyeth Increatos Loz Farsas.

00:36.260 --> 00:39.260
<b>Gait                              Nephelli    Princess of Yarda                         Iosef</b>

00:36.650 --> 00:38.770
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:38.770 --> 00:41.770
My name is Nephelli Initia Lyn Yarda.

00:47.690 --> 00:49.610
They really found her.

00:49.610 --> 00:55.770
First, let me say that Farsas has no intent 
of making known our intervention here.

00:55.770 --> 00:58.200
I hope you can say the same.

00:58.200 --> 01:00.130
I understand.

01:00.130 --> 01:03.160
But what is the king of Farsas doing here?

01:03.480 --> 01:05.740
They're the ones who attacked us first.

01:06.470 --> 01:07.630
Besides...

01:07.630 --> 01:11.340
I'm the prime candidate 
to be dealing with a witch.

01:11.340 --> 01:12.180
What?

01:12.670 --> 01:17.760
U-Um, are you saying that woman 
who's cajoled the prince...

01:17.760 --> 01:19.260
Is a witch?

01:19.260 --> 01:20.720
That's right.

01:22.020 --> 01:24.050
Wh-What does a witch want with us?

01:24.430 --> 01:27.090
Leonora is the Witch Who Cannot Be Summoned.

01:27.090 --> 01:30.350
True to her name, 
she shows up without any invitation.

01:30.650 --> 01:32.380
You were simply unlucky.

01:33.360 --> 01:36.490
Now then, how do we lure Leonora out?

01:37.070 --> 01:39.920
Once she finds out I've come 
into contact with Princess Nephelli,

01:39.920 --> 01:41.770
I'm sure she'll be here in no time.

01:42.080 --> 01:46.290
We could also get rid of this sandstorm 
around the fortress, just to make sure.

01:46.580 --> 01:49.010
Leonora's got a short temper, 
so winning will be easy.

01:49.410 --> 01:51.380
I'd say you have a short temper, too.

01:51.720 --> 01:54.840
By the way, when I visited 
the royal court of Yarda just now...

01:54.840 --> 01:56.050
What?!

01:56.050 --> 01:57.760
Did I hear that right just now?

01:57.760 --> 01:59.260
Ow, ow, ow!

01:59.260 --> 02:01.920
Look, even if we kill Leonora,

02:01.920 --> 02:06.230
there's no guarantee it'll stop the 
civil war she's been orchestrating!

02:06.230 --> 02:09.050
We need to delay it somehow.

02:10.330 --> 02:11.940
Be more specific.

02:12.950 --> 02:17.400
I teleported most of the faction leaders 
out to the borders of Yarda.

02:17.740 --> 02:20.280
The mages have had their powers sealed,

02:20.280 --> 02:23.010
and the army's out of commission 
thanks to laxatives.

02:23.010 --> 02:25.170
You're pretty ruthless yourself...

02:25.920 --> 02:29.750
The king had fallen ill 
from potions, so I cured him.

02:30.650 --> 02:34.280
Also, I talked briefly with Prince Savas.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.670
With my brother?!

02:35.670 --> 02:36.730
Yes.

02:36.730 --> 02:39.320
He seems to be regretting his actions,

02:39.320 --> 02:41.070
so I think he'll buy us time.

02:41.730 --> 02:44.180
That's a fair bit of meddling you've done.

02:44.180 --> 02:47.100
All in a day's work cleaning up after a witch.

02:47.770 --> 02:52.060
And so, we'll have Leonora meet her end here.

04:23.240 --> 04:27.990
~ Castle of Sand ~

04:33.290 --> 04:35.420
I see. Thanks.

04:36.790 --> 04:40.130
Will the spirits be able 
to handle the demons there?

04:40.450 --> 04:42.940
They say they can, so I'll leave it to them.

04:42.940 --> 04:45.030
You fought her once before, right?

04:45.570 --> 04:47.050
How did it go back then?

04:47.450 --> 04:48.650
I won.

04:48.970 --> 04:51.430
What do you need me to do?

04:51.430 --> 04:53.490
Let me see.

04:53.490 --> 04:55.700
Can you take care of Unai?

04:55.700 --> 05:01.530
Leonora had him absorb a demon, so he 
boasts outlandish, inhuman physical strength.

05:01.530 --> 05:03.100
Don't worry.

05:03.100 --> 05:04.510
I'll take him down with ease.

05:06.950 --> 05:09.160
Stop acting all on your own.

05:19.320 --> 05:23.510
I can't forgive the one 
who tried to kill you.

05:34.810 --> 05:35.890
Stop that.

05:36.650 --> 05:37.640
Why?

05:37.640 --> 05:40.110
Find the right time and place for that!

05:40.400 --> 05:41.500
Got it.

05:42.570 --> 05:44.280
You don't get it at all!

05:44.280 --> 05:47.520
I'd regret it if I stopped now 
and died tomorrow.

05:47.520 --> 05:49.700
Don't be so ominous!

05:55.290 --> 05:57.360
I don't believe it!

05:57.360 --> 05:59.830
The sandstorm... is gone.

06:03.190 --> 06:07.220
It should be an hour at least 
until Leonora gets here.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.780
Go wake yourself up and come back.

06:09.780 --> 06:11.180
Pamyra, if you would.

06:11.180 --> 06:12.690
As you wish.

06:18.750 --> 06:19.670
Unai!

06:20.150 --> 06:20.990
I'm here.

06:20.980 --> 06:23.980
<b>Unai    Servant to Leonora</b>

06:21.580 --> 06:24.110
They stopped the sandstorm.

06:24.110 --> 06:26.330
We're going to go kill that woman.

06:26.330 --> 06:27.530
Get yourself ready.

06:27.530 --> 06:28.820
As you wish.

06:39.630 --> 06:41.490
I feel alert now.

06:41.490 --> 06:44.740
I just can't stand being 
woken up by someone else.

06:44.740 --> 06:46.580
I should have slept by myself.

06:47.220 --> 06:50.260
If you had, I would have woken you up.

06:56.090 --> 06:58.020
I took the liberty of going first.

06:58.020 --> 06:59.070
It's fine...

07:10.540 --> 07:12.860
Lady Tinasha, your neck...

07:13.380 --> 07:14.950
I'm so sorry.

07:20.900 --> 07:24.960
Why are you with that man?

07:25.740 --> 07:30.600
Are you planning to manipulate him, 
like that witch did to my brother?

07:30.600 --> 07:32.440
Oh, my apologies.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.570
Ignore what I said.

07:33.570 --> 07:35.430
Manipulate him?

07:35.430 --> 07:38.380
He doesn't listen to a thing I say.

07:38.380 --> 07:41.010
I'd say he's the one in control of me.

07:43.140 --> 07:44.490
Princess Nephelli.

07:46.310 --> 07:49.820
Do you want him for yourself?

07:56.380 --> 07:59.810
<i>If witches hadn't interfered...</i>

08:00.580 --> 08:04.460
<i>she could have become the queen of Farsas.</i>

08:04.910 --> 08:08.310
<i>If the Witch of Silence hadn't 
placed that curse on Oscar...</i>

08:08.860 --> 08:11.700
<i>If a protector by the name of 
Tinasha had never shown up...</i>

08:12.610 --> 08:15.540
<i>If Leonora hadn't set her sights on Yarda...</i>

08:19.290 --> 08:21.730
<i>The fates of humans are strange indeed...</i>

08:22.250 --> 08:25.470
<i>And witches toy with them as they like.</i>

08:26.070 --> 08:27.580
<i>That's why I...</i>

08:28.510 --> 08:30.540
Wretched child.

08:32.440 --> 08:34.290
You're scared of people?

08:34.290 --> 08:36.770
You don't want to touch 
or be touched by anyone?

08:37.920 --> 08:40.120
Live life a little more freely.

08:40.120 --> 08:42.100
Do as you like.

08:42.100 --> 08:45.330
We have the power needed to do so.

08:46.220 --> 08:48.290
<i>I'd never even dreamed of it.</i>

08:48.850 --> 08:54.260
<i>That anyone would desire me as a fellow human.</i>

08:57.180 --> 08:58.700
<i>It's fine.</i>

08:59.180 --> 09:00.560
<i>I can stand proud.</i>

09:00.560 --> 09:02.410
<i>I can face her now.</i>

09:04.460 --> 09:06.450
It's been exactly one hour.

09:09.920 --> 09:10.790
Well...

09:11.710 --> 09:12.940
I'll be off.

09:21.380 --> 09:22.420
You're late.

09:22.420 --> 09:23.550
Sorry.

09:28.660 --> 09:29.550
What's this?

09:30.420 --> 09:32.860
If anything happens, pull on this.

09:33.330 --> 09:36.090
The sensation will transfer to this one.

09:36.090 --> 09:37.980
The sensation will transfer?

09:38.470 --> 09:39.680
That's it?

09:40.830 --> 09:42.930
That's more than enough.

09:45.500 --> 09:46.900
Got it.

09:46.900 --> 09:47.850
That'll do.

09:54.290 --> 09:55.340
Tinasha.

09:55.340 --> 09:56.260
Yes?

09:56.260 --> 09:58.060
Once this fight is over...

10:00.330 --> 10:01.370
What is it?

10:02.130 --> 10:03.460
Why don't we get married?

10:05.380 --> 10:06.710
Fine by me.

10:06.710 --> 10:07.960
I accept.

10:08.470 --> 10:09.790
Are you serious?

10:10.380 --> 10:11.270
Of course.

10:14.850 --> 10:16.650
Now I can't afford to lose.

10:16.650 --> 10:18.900
Were you planning to lose before?

10:20.310 --> 10:23.150
Okay, time for this war to begin.

10:29.260 --> 10:31.090
There's too many of them.

10:31.980 --> 10:34.570
It's been so long, little girl.

10:37.020 --> 10:38.900
I've come to show myself.

10:38.900 --> 10:40.660
Are you happy now?

10:50.020 --> 10:52.540
Don't you worry about Unai.

10:52.540 --> 10:55.000
My man will entertain him.

10:55.000 --> 10:58.720
How cheeky, coming from a spirit sorcerer 
stripped of her purity.

10:58.970 --> 11:01.400
It gave me a chance to reorganize my spells.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.410
I'm dying to test them out.

11:03.410 --> 11:04.680
How foolish.

11:05.200 --> 11:08.060
I'll live my life however I want!

11:09.140 --> 11:10.390
Strike true!

11:19.060 --> 11:22.340
I need to deliver a deadlier blow, huh?

11:40.750 --> 11:43.260
"Inhuman" is a fitting word here.

11:43.590 --> 11:46.120
Try as you might, it's all futile!

11:46.120 --> 11:48.560
You're bound by your human limits.

11:48.560 --> 11:52.020
Why don't you try me, then?!

11:52.700 --> 11:55.080
Not bad, little girl.

11:55.080 --> 11:57.290
This much is nothing special.

11:57.290 --> 11:59.230
We're both witches here.

11:59.230 --> 12:01.420
I'm well aware of that.

12:01.420 --> 12:03.350
Much more than you are.

12:04.050 --> 12:06.260
So why don't I show you?

12:06.260 --> 12:08.920
You and that lukewarm life you've lived...

12:08.920 --> 12:11.160
Here's what a real witch can do!

12:12.620 --> 12:15.700
That which is changing and nonexistent...

12:16.110 --> 12:17.840
Cease to fluctuate.

12:18.160 --> 12:20.170
Destroy your form.

12:20.170 --> 12:22.290
Reach your finite limits.

12:22.930 --> 12:26.390
Appear before me, my eternal stone.

12:39.610 --> 12:40.870
Oscar!

12:40.870 --> 12:41.910
I'll teleport you...

12:47.390 --> 12:48.830
Blood-red butterflies?

13:04.090 --> 13:05.430
The Amber Castle...

13:06.340 --> 13:08.180
Beautiful, isn't it?

13:08.180 --> 13:10.700
I made it a long time ago.

13:10.700 --> 13:13.300
You trapped all the humans inside, too?!

13:13.820 --> 13:14.560
Oscar!

13:30.670 --> 13:32.040
Meaning, be destroyed!

13:32.420 --> 13:34.720
Let my intentions alter this world!

13:34.720 --> 13:35.620
Be destroyed!

13:39.080 --> 13:40.040
Be destroyed!

13:51.740 --> 13:53.670
Did she do something?

13:54.960 --> 13:57.520
Sorry, but if I don't get back soon,

13:57.900 --> 13:59.970
my cat's going to be very angry with me.

14:04.440 --> 14:09.160
You really have been a wretched child 
these four hundred years.

14:09.650 --> 14:13.860
This is what happens 
when you grow attached to a human.

14:19.080 --> 14:22.260
Learn your place, winged vermin!

14:22.260 --> 14:24.550
I'll tear you into pieces.

14:28.150 --> 14:30.210
Who did you say you'll kill?

14:34.100 --> 14:35.230
Why, you...

14:36.290 --> 14:39.740
I'll make you regret ever becoming a witch.

14:41.790 --> 14:43.130
<i>I want to kill her.</i>

14:46.570 --> 14:47.690
<i>I can do it!</i>

14:52.710 --> 14:54.740
<i>That's what these powers are for!</i>

15:02.190 --> 15:03.380
<i>Oscar!</i>

15:15.480 --> 15:18.020
I'm going to set aside my hatred for you.

15:18.020 --> 15:19.090
Why?

15:19.530 --> 15:21.700
With all that power at your command...

15:28.340 --> 15:30.420
I'll beat you with my mind at ease.

15:30.900 --> 15:32.050
Come here.

15:32.050 --> 15:33.620
Let's have some fun.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.260
What's wrong?

16:02.260 --> 16:04.060
Giving up already?

16:04.060 --> 16:05.020
No.

16:05.570 --> 16:07.520
I just happen to know.

16:07.520 --> 16:08.890
Know what?

16:16.350 --> 16:18.590
She'd never lose to anyone.

16:25.880 --> 16:29.290
She seems really angry.

16:29.290 --> 16:30.340
Also...

16:30.660 --> 16:32.800
What's with that injury?

16:32.800 --> 16:34.060
Sorry.

16:34.060 --> 16:35.510
I'll treat it later.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.420
Hmph!

16:36.420 --> 16:38.530
It's like you're a run-of-the-mill woman.

16:38.530 --> 16:40.600
How low you've fallen.

16:40.600 --> 16:43.640
It looks like we see things differently.

16:43.640 --> 16:46.900
For me, he's the reason 
I can stay a decent person.

16:47.560 --> 16:49.030
How utterly absurd!

16:51.740 --> 16:55.710
Leonora can quickly 
heal herself after most attacks.

16:55.710 --> 16:58.400
Her magic increases 
as long as this castle's here,

16:58.400 --> 17:00.450
so a drawn-out battle is not in our favor.

17:00.450 --> 17:01.080
That's why...

17:03.500 --> 17:06.120
It's about time we end this fight.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.320
How pointless!

17:32.320 --> 17:34.780
I wouldn't call it pointless.

17:49.850 --> 17:51.960
Craft as many spells you want,

17:51.960 --> 17:53.670
but they're meaningless in this castle!

17:56.160 --> 17:57.330
Die!

18:26.180 --> 18:28.000
Unai...

18:34.910 --> 18:38.140
You switched your places?

18:41.350 --> 18:42.420
Unai...

18:43.070 --> 18:47.030
I'll be taking a short nap...

19:10.860 --> 19:12.260
Is it all over now?

19:12.970 --> 19:14.310
Yes...

19:16.340 --> 19:17.670
It's all over.

19:28.890 --> 19:31.190
Leonora has been slain.

19:31.190 --> 19:33.300
You'll hold up your end of our promise, right?

19:33.870 --> 19:35.150
I understand.

19:35.460 --> 19:37.560
As long as your blood runs in their veins,

19:37.560 --> 19:39.360
I won't lay a finger on Farsas.

19:39.640 --> 19:43.570
I'd rather you leave them alone regardless.

19:46.180 --> 19:48.300
What will you do now?

19:48.300 --> 19:49.870
Let me see...

19:49.870 --> 19:53.410
I'll live my life with him, then die.

19:56.210 --> 19:59.130
The bride is that infamous witch, right?

19:59.130 --> 20:00.530
What do you think she's like?

20:00.530 --> 20:04.050
I bet she's dressed in all black, 
wrinkly, and absolutely terrifyi—

20:09.910 --> 20:11.180
Lady Tinasha.

20:11.410 --> 20:13.730
Please try and smile a little.

20:13.730 --> 20:15.980
That's a difficult order.

20:15.980 --> 20:17.070
Missy!

20:17.400 --> 20:18.620
Saye!

20:18.620 --> 20:19.920
Wait, no!

20:19.920 --> 20:22.200
So you were the witch, Lady Tinasha?

20:22.200 --> 20:24.130
Yes, that's right.

20:24.130 --> 20:26.820
When I grow up, I'll become a soldier!

20:26.820 --> 20:29.660
I'll become strong enough to protect you!

20:31.110 --> 20:32.790
I look forward to it.

20:38.840 --> 20:41.840
<b>Lavinia    Witch of Silence</b>

20:39.100 --> 20:41.490
[Lavinia. It's been a while.]

20:41.990 --> 20:45.630
[Did you come to see him? Or kill him?]

20:46.620 --> 20:49.730
[I'm just here to get a look 
at his eccentric bride.]

20:52.450 --> 20:56.550
I, Oscar Lyeth Increatos Loz Farsas,

20:57.210 --> 21:01.400
take thee, Tinasha As Meyer Ur Aeterna Tuldarr,

21:01.660 --> 21:07.820
as queen of Farsas, granting you 
all rights as my lawfully wedded wife.

21:15.610 --> 21:17.540
I hereby accept.

21:17.540 --> 21:22.300
I pledge upon my name and blood 
to take thee as my husband

21:22.300 --> 21:24.720
and bestow upon thee all that is mine.

21:34.070 --> 21:36.930
Your Majesty, I am your witch.

21:36.930 --> 21:38.900
And you are my king.

21:39.650 --> 21:43.290
As a witch, I give you my undying love.

21:45.820 --> 21:48.940
To think that I really 
did end up changing my mind...

21:58.810 --> 22:01.590
I love you, Oscar.

23:35.470 --> 23:40.020
~ Two Joined Memories ~
